<title>USA: HBO &amp; CO SETS STOCK SPLIT, RAISES DIV.</title>
<headline>HBO &amp; CO SETS STOCK SPLIT, RAISES DIV.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>HBO &amp; Co said Monday it had declared a two-for-one stock split and doubled its quarterly dividend.</p>
<p>The split is payable September 9, record August 25.</p>
<p>The company said it would raise its quarterly dividend to $0.02 a share on post-split shares, payable October 22, record September 30. The company also paid $0.02 a share before the split.</p>
<p>HBO &amp; Co delivers patient care, clinical, financial and strategic management software solutions, as well as networking technologies, electronic data interchange, outsourcing and other services, to healthcare organizations.</p>
</text>
